y that I did not appreciate your disrespectful attitude.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":118,"nodeId":124}]},"85":{"id":85,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Nia tried to hold her and get her to sit down.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":118,"nodeId":90},{"convId":118,"nodeId":89},{"convId":118,"nodeId":88}]},"86":{"id":86,"speaker":"Ciara Walda","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"I am sorry, Mr. President. But I had to be honest with you. Please do not make such a mistake.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":118,"nodeId":87}]},"87":{"id":87,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"She sat down, her eyes locked on me.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":118,"nodeId":91},{"convId":118,"nodeId":97}]},"88":{"id":88,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"\"You are right to question this decision. As a matter of fact, I am open to reconsider it.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":118,"nodeId":86}]},"89":{"id":89,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"\"I have heard enough. The deal is a done deal. Let's move on.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":118,"nodeId":54}]},"90":{"id":90,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"\"I appreciate your opinion. But the alliance is going to happen.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":118,"nodeId":54}]},"91":{"id":91,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"\"Let's vote on it.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":118,"nodeId":105}]},"92":{"id":92,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"I see.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variab